82236066928451_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=fQ7jsgk3otoQ7kNvwE5T1tT&_nc_oc=AdpiBYPK2miJD99Q1H-ShS1hqCTjXBPonj25OA6SSrartW_oyuVa1xGheYzl1bpIowc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8xYaUUL_MNc2EIjZzEsKuvT8ihOwBi9JCt9Msef0yUow&oe=6A3FD27F"}, {"file_name": "FluentXR_Media Storage_Screenshot.png", "id": "3267266376829151", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974717_3267266380162484_3578961694161774596_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=YzDclEQcawgQ7kNvwGyCXWI&_nc_oc=AdqArrgwdVqSNQE_g__w-TkFfdTRWVVvC0Iwv6UziOQWqErx3RLyEMSCAiAAFRBrUww&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-Z-ZRMSOQjiYqZ64ClPjntXh0f5PqLSk2Sf2YllWTHRA&oe=6A3FEBD6"}, {"file_name": "FluentXR_Throw Pillow_Screenshot.png", "id": "3559508997603615", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974691_3559509000936948_3261126970408815056_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8gLjQaVB_54Q7kNvwFS6zoV&_nc_oc=Adq9kOSKjWbsNnGYBk66xqbvzdcRQzSa2ZtdqhNUiVoW6-tsu_634AwQzj8scTrSPPo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-DeiC1PpcpCdpQl3v0s4Z8UW_l9bvmvfrzw7KhIu3iSQ&oe=6A3FE2BD"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "FluentXR", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Unlock a personalized language learning journey through your mixed reality home. FluentXR transforms your space into an interactive learning environment.\n\nStep into a realm where learning is not just fun and effective, but also deeply personalized. FluentXR is not just another language learning app; it's your own private linguistics lab.\n\nTag real-world objects in your space with text and audio labels, making learning immersive and contextually relevant. Dive into our Word Shuffle mini-game to reinforce your skills and challenge yourself using the timer.\n\nCurrent Features:\nSpace: Living Room\nMain Language: English\nLearning: French / fran\u00e7ais\nMini-Game: Word Shuffle\n470+ available tags geared towards common living room objects such as \u201cCouch\u201d, \u201cTelevision\u201d, \u201cChess Set\u201d and \u201cGaming Console\u201d\n\nFluentXR is an ever-evolving platform, continually expanding its selection of languages, locations, and mini-games. Achieve language mastery with FluentXR\u2014where your home becomes your classroom.\n\nNext Expansion: \nSpace: Kitchen\nSpace: Bedroom\nMain Language: French\nLearning Language: Spanish / espa\u00f1ol \nLearning Language: English\nMini-Game: Sentence Scramble", "short_description": "Transform your language learning experience. \n\nUtilizing mixed-reality passthrough technology turn your home into a dynamic classroom. Tag real-world objects in your living room with 470+ customizable tags for learning French. Sharpen your skills through the Word Shuffle mini-game.\n\nFluentXR is an ever-evolving platform, updating with new languages, locations, and interactive mini-games. Dive into a context-rich home environment that's both captivating and practical."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Fluent XR Mobile Icon.png", "id": "2236631716529956", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974513_2236631719863289_7778467312643440417_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=OujnF0U-IBgQ7kNvwFhI5Ud&_nc_oc=AdoTjnKxy3yL7HROWcYK5ZQAVmRnQPJVqN7GjBkmNh5cew4IxgIA0rR4v0a3gf6m0NI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8qx3zt9SznD83iCIcVlGLyH6-XH6QMrSeScwhZz7NKNA&oe=6A3FD5D5"}, {"file_name": "Fluent XR PDP Art.png", "id": "2055286771488876", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974466_2055286774822209_4338361723960595313_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=PJ0FbJ6C7ecQ7kNvwGulIky&_nc_oc=AdqXnDNYlx73jGd6xg0FnrGvMiHbbyei7lWHcpniNKM0nrvNIeQvjkOtP3JE3BiyDgM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af97bhmXEf